abstract: >-
  An AI-assisted, entirely digital project connecting conditional spinal-interface
  mechanisms for expert-informed retained motor learning and selected physiological
  feedback to computational studies, executed production control code, native
  electronics, target-linked firmware and mechanical CAD. No original biological
  experiment, physical execution or clinical effectiveness is claimed.
